{"2791230": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Path of Ambition: The Sun Rise", "steam_appid": 2791230, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2791230/extras/81b3c077ba0e1b033938ebd2d9bff6a6.avif?t=1787986960\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>關於異麒麟：旭日初升</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >「《異麒麟：旭日初升》以架空的三國歷史為背景，講述一名因災變而流離失所，帶著妹妹浪跡天涯的少年，流落并州後因緣際會加入「英豪府」——以此為始，以後如何，由你創造！ 麒麟原是太平盛世的徵兆，冠上「異」名，則造就亂世之始。而「異」一字，就是本作的核心。」</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>｜一念成佛成魔｜</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >念起緣生，因果循環，萬般皆是代價！</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2791230/extras/3eef7eb2c62981bf9b5785be97e3b153.poster.avif?t=1787986960\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2791230/extras/3eef7eb2c62981bf9b5785be97e3b153.webm?t=1787986960\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2791230/extras/3eef7eb2c62981bf9b5785be97e3b153.mp4?t=1787986960\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>｜自選出身文化與人物背景｜</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >王侯將相寧有種乎？燕雀亦存鴻鵠志！於大廈將傾時殺出天命！</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2791230/extras/00aee6087b73013f5546a9a6ac15fc4a.poster.avif?t=1787986960\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.